..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : ENTRYCERTIFICATE.ARCHIVE
.. Author         : saac
.. Verantwortlich : teamreport
.. Kontrolle      : cl
.. Functionality  : Defines parameters to create a document using mask context.
.. xid     = sales/purchasing document the future document record is linked to
.. xbeldat = date of this document
.. ATTENTION: This program must not call fo command .end. Each error handling
..            must take place outside this fop. Example see ev/VORGANG.SPERR
.. Includes       :
.. include ev/VORGANG.ARCHIVE
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.continue ? _F|defined(M|lskopf)
.. Declarations
.type VID99 xid     ? _F|defined(U|xid)
.type text  xbeldat ? _F|defined(U|xbeldat)
..
.. Define parameters
.assign U|xid = M|lskopf
.formula U|xbeldat = 'U|xid^vom'
..
.input "ev/VORGANG.ARCHIVE"
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
